// Rock Standard Library
//
// Domain modules own their implementations and public re-exports.
// The prelude exposes the same common items independently of this layout.

// ============================================================================
// Operator precedence declarations (higher = binds tighter)
// ALL operators must be declared here - no hardcoded defaults
// ============================================================================
infix 1 ||
infix 1 |>
infix 1 |>>
infix 2 &&
infix 3 |
infix 4 ^
infix 5 &
infix 6 ==
infix 6 !=
infix 7 <
infix 7 <=
infix 7 >
infix 7 >=
infix 8 <<
infix 8 >>
infix 8 >>=
infix 9 +
infix 9 -
infix 8 <|>
infix 8 <$>
infix 8 <&>
infix 8 <*>
infix 8 <!>
infix 8 !>
infix 10 *
infix 10 /
infix 10 %

< mod ffi
< mod mem
< mod num
< mod cmp
< mod clone
< mod convert
< mod hash
< mod show
< mod ops
< mod functional
< mod control
< mod collections
< mod string
< mod concurrency
< mod env
< mod io

// Prelude module - re-exports of all items available without qualification
mod prelude
